#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"At this point, we are already set to classically simulate the expectation value using OBP.\n"
"To do so, we simply provide the _all_ the slices to the `backpropagate` method, like so:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sa puntong ito, handa na tayong i-simulate nang classical ang expectation value gamit ang OBP.\n"
"Para gawin ito, ibibigay lang natin ang _lahat_ ng slice sa method na `backpropagate`, ganito:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We have now backpropagated our target observable `obs` through the _entire_ circuit (**including** the `initial_state` which we placed on `slices[0]`) resulting in a new `SparsePauliOp` whose expectation value we obtain by projecting it on the _vacuum state_ (`|00...00>`).\n"
msgstr "Na-backpropagate na natin ang ating target na observable na `obs` sa _buong_ circuit (**kasama** ang `initial_state` na inilagay natin sa `slices[0]`) na nagresulta sa bagong `SparsePauliOp` na ang expectation value ay makukuha natin sa pag-project nito sa _vacuum state_ (`|00...00>`).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
